# Configuration and credentials must be supplied at runtime, never copied into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials.json
**/secrets
**/.aws
**/.ssh

# Source-control metadata, local tooling, and generated output.
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/tmp
**/coverage
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/*.log
